@startuml
title Create Product - sequence (as implemented)
actor User
participant UI as "MyInventorySystem"
participant Manager as "InventoryManager"

User -> UI: chooses "Add Product"
UI -> UI: gather inputs and validate
UI -> Manager: AddProduct(Product)
Manager --> UI: "<product name> has been added to the inventory." (or error)
UI -> User: show confirmation
@enduml
